(Data you can use on UI \(descriptive\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Live) Tj
T*
(- **Selected weight \(kg\)**: current load chosen for the set.) Tj
T*
(- **Suggested load seed \(kg\)**: baseline recommended weight before live adjustments.) Tj
T*
(- **Weight factor**: multiplier used to scale suggested load for user/goal context.) Tj
T*
(- **Current set / target sets**: progress through the workout plan \(example `2 / 4`\).) Tj
T*
(- **Reps in set / target reps**: progress inside the active set \(example `7 / 10`\).) Tj
T*
(- **ROM %**: current range of motion depth as a percent \(0-100\).) Tj
T*
(- **User ROM bounds**: personalized range limits \(`userBottomPct` to `userTopPct`\).) Tj
T*
(- **Velocity \(%/s\)**: movement speed normalized as percent per second.) Tj
T*
(- **Rep phase**: live phase label \(`LIFT`, `LOWER`, `HOLD`, `REST`\).) Tj
T*
(- **Quality state**: fast coaching state \(`READY`, `SLOW`, `SPEED OK`, `TOO FAST`,) Tj
T*
(  etc.\).) Tj
T*
(- **Session timer**: elapsed workout time in the active session.) Tj
T*
(- **Rest countdown**: seconds remaining before the next set.) Tj
T*
(- **Rest target \(`restSeconds`\)**: planned rest time for the current exercise/goal.) Tj
T*
(- **Rep timing \(ms\)**:) Tj
T*
(  - `riseMs`: concentric/lift duration) Tj
T*
(  - `lowerMs`: eccentric/lower duration) Tj
T*
ET
