(Motion guide \(important\)) Tj
T*
(- **Ideal motion curve**: target path for a good rep over time.) Tj
T*
(- **Live dot position**: athlete?s current movement point plotted on that graph.) Tj
T*
(- **Live halo**: visual emphasis around the live dot so it?s easy to follow quickly.) Tj
T*
(- **On-path state**: whether live movement is close enough to the ideal path.) Tj
T*
(- **ROM target band**: highlighted target ROM zone \(single fixed chart mode, no expanded) Tj
T*
(  graph\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Session end / summary) Tj
T*
(- **Quality score + tier**: overall session quality \(0-100\) and readable tier label.) Tj
T*
(- **Sets completed**: completed sets vs planned sets.) Tj
T*
(- **Valid / invalid reps + valid rate**: accepted reps, rejected reps, and success) Tj
T*
(  percentage.) Tj
T*
(- **Average ROM %**: average ROM on valid reps.) Tj
T*
(- **Average velocity \(%/s\)**: average rep speed on valid reps.) Tj
T*
(- **Volume load \(kg\)**: total effective load \(`selected weight * valid reps`\).) Tj
T*
(- **Duration**: total session time \(`mm:ss` or similar\).) Tj
T*
(- **Sync/storage status**: whether saved locally, queued, or synced.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Extra useful values you can show \(already available\)) Tj
T*
(- **Best ROM %**: best rep ROM reached in the session.) Tj
T*
(- **Average eccentric velocity \(%/s\)**: lowering-phase speed quality signal.) Tj
T*
(- **Fast eccentric warnings**: count of reps lowered too quickly.) Tj
T*
(- **Total rest time**: total rest accumulated in session.) Tj
T*
(- **Average rest per set**: pacing indicator.) Tj
T*
(- **Rep quality trend**: first sets vs last sets quality change.) Tj
T*
(- **Fatigue ROM drop**: ROM loss from early to late sets.) Tj
T*
(- **Fatigue velocity drop**: speed loss from early to late sets.) Tj
T*
(- **ROM compliance rate**: percent of valid reps that met user ROM target.) Tj
T*
(- **Ideal ROM hit rate**: percent of valid reps that met machine ideal ROM target.) Tj
T*
(- **Invalid reason breakdown**:) Tj
T*
